.zcode/

# Local tooling artefacts, never part of the package.
# `.codegraph/` is the index of a local code-graph tool; `.zcodeignore` is the
# editor's own copy of this file.
.codegraph/
.zcodeignore

# The local scratch corpus this repository was written against. Slashless on
# purpose: `.dev` is a *symlink* on the author's machine, and git does not treat
# a symlink as a directory, so `.dev/` and `.dev/**` both fail to match it and
# `git status` kept reporting `?? .dev`. One bare name matches the symlink, its
# contents, and anything created under it. Verified by
# `git check-ignore -v .dev` and asserted by tests/test_no_dev_references.py.
.dev
